This is a modified, focused local source fork of Providence's native editor.
Providence source is copyright its contributors, GPL-3.0-or-later.
See LICENSE and docs/providence-reuse-audit.md for exact source provenance.

Generic text conversion, byte-ownership inspection, scene
composition, paint-stroke collection and redirected-I/O framing are adapted
from Providence. The UI theme is generated from this editor's own design
tokens and reuses none of Providence's. Exact UI provenance is in docs/ui-provenance.json.
The PICT raster decoder is adapted from the read-only Centurions reference
under GPL-3.0-or-later. No Realmz records, opcodes, artwork, scenario data, or runtime are
used as Centurions format authority. Centurions record layouts were independently
implemented from the read-only reconstruction references. The original game
binary remains behavior authority. Original game assets are not distributed.
